        "message": "=The assistant could not confidently process a reported life event.\n\nReported event type: {{ $(\"Event Form\").item.json[\"Event Type\"] }}\nEvent date: {{ $(\"Event Form\").item.json[\"Event Date\"] }}\nDetails: {{ $(\"Event Form\").item.json[\"Details\"] }}\n\nClassifier result: {{ JSON.stringify($json.output) }}\n\nPlease review and log the event manually.",
